{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__computer-control#feature-1","repo":"JohnXu22786/computer-control","commit":"5957f2c8a0f0880409b37c9aa7c0eea24565f0c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"computer-control 的功能「屏幕截图」：获取全屏或指定区域的桌面图像，可设置输出格式、缩放和灰度。通过 screen.capture 工具触发，返回图像及画布尺寸等信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["computer_control/actions.py:94","computer_control/engine.py:36"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__computer-control#feature-2","repo":"JohnXu22786/computer-control","commit":"5957f2c8a0f0880409b37c9aa7c0eea24565f0c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"computer-control 的功能「鼠标与键盘操作」：可移动、点击、拖动和滚动鼠标，也可按键、组合按键或输入文本。由 pointer.* 与 keyboard.* 工具调用，参数包括坐标、按键或文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["computer_control/actions.py:123","computer_control/actions.py:184"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__computer-control#feature-3","repo":"JohnXu22786/computer-control","commit":"5957f2c8a0f0880409b37c9aa7c0eea24565f0c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"computer-control 的功能「辅助功能树操作」：生成桌面控件的分级语义摘要，并可激活控件或向可编辑项输入文本。调用 a11y.snapshot 获取快照，再用对应语义工具操作快照中的元素。","source":"generated","evidence":["computer_control/actions.py:206","computer_control/actions.py:224"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__computer-control#feature-4","repo":"JohnXu22786/computer-control","commit":"5957f2c8a0f0880409b37c9aa7c0eea24565f0c9","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"computer-control 的功能「批量动作」：一次提交多个工具动作，减少调用往返；通过 batch.execute 触发，可设置失败后是否继续以及动作间隔，并返回各项结果。","source":"generated","evidence":["computer_control/actions.py:243","computer_control/engine.py:36"]}
